<title>UK: Both Brent dates clocked - traders.</title>
<headline>Both Brent dates clocked - traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The two Brent dates nominated from the paper chains on Wednesday were both clocked, traders said.</p>
<p>They said that Suko was clocked by Cargill with a Dec 12-14 cargo and Nova was clocked by Morgan Stanley with another cargo with the same loading dates.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
</text>
